      "writtenOn": "2021-06-01T18:37:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function would be called whenever CONFIG_DEBUG_FS is not enabled i.e. in \"user\" flavor builds. The function is called in multiple places in tcpm.c whenever an event needs to be logged.\n\nIf android_vendor_data1 was set by trace_android_vh_typec_tcpm_enable_log handler, then, the variable argument list would be converted to string and passed down to trace_android_vh_typec_tcpm_log\u0027s handler as a string since vendor hooks don\u0027t support variable argument.",
      "parentUuid": "e515a084_dbd3e810",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 769,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 769,
        "endChar": 72
      },
